  "concept_evidence": [
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/13-01-lesson.md:29",
      "judgment": "Send/marker/auto trait與prelude/std::marker來源在helper前；只是檢查bound、不建立thread有明說。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/13-01-lesson.md:43",
      "judgment": "T:Sync iff &T:Send準確；ownership/shared reference與借用權限不混。String/Vec/Box有heap仍可Send/Sync，Cell/RefCell Send取決T、非Sync及Rc非Send/Sync表均正確。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/13-01-lesson.md:162",
      "judgment": "Rc管理計數也需共享保護；move capture不修其Send。Fn系列呼叫能力與Send/Sync不同；reference可Send不代表static，require_sync(&str)的T=str及?Sized精確。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/13-02-lesson.md:13",
      "judgment": "spawn<F,T>FnOnce()+Send+static與結果T:Send+static兩組bound先教；create failure可能panic、handle不是已算成果。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/13-02-lesson.md:36",
      "judgment": "join consumes唯一handle且blocking，thread::Result alias與Box<dynAny+Send+static>先解；unwind才能join Err，abort無此保證。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/13-02-lesson.md:138",
      "judgment": "join外層Ok只是正常回傳，T內層Result仍可能業務Err；loop每次spawn後立即join使兩行順序有依據。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/13-02-lesson.md:159",
      "judgment": "panic文字可能String/staticstr、downcast Err保留Send、未知payload不假解讀；stdout報告與標準panic stderr並存有明說。literal type suffix7_u32在test首用前教，u32本身已由1.4:35/types.rs教。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/13-02-lesson.md:216",
      "judgment": "drop handle detach不等待/不取消，process結束可遺留未完成；答案兩次spawn後兩次join都先存再match，第一Err也不略過第二等待。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/13-03-lesson.md:23",
      "judgment": "on_caller外層'a只要求當次來源；函式內建立value卻要求外部'a時generic body不能假設足夠短，E0597對source。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/13-03-lesson.md:59",
      "judgment": "for<'a> bound內任一合法借用、T在binder外、不是runtime迴圈且FnOnce仍只呼叫一次。static-only callback不夠general，fixedT不能攜局部輸入borrow。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/13-03-lesson.md:107",
      "judgment": "HRTB輸入通用不要求capture static或輸出owned；外部String view回傳T合法，局部number view不合法；FnOnce/FnMut/Fn與borrowrank分清。"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/chapters/13-03-lesson.md:166",
      "judgment": "projection輸出明連每次'a，fn pointer單輸入elision保留higher-rank契約；sum_selected在tuple結束前Copy出兩值，回126不帶borrow。省略FnOnce(&i32)->T與明寫for等價，外層明寫'a非同契約。"
    }
  ],
